{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban the media from reporting on cause of death until emergency services confirm",
        "additional_details": "Media outlets should never run stories that make claims on the cause of death and may spread speculation about incidents on coastal or inland waters \u2014until every detail is fully confirmed by emergency services.\r\n \r\nWe call for this out of deep respect for families who may not even know their loved one is involved - unconfirmed reports can cause terrible, avoidable pain. We believe families have the right to be told directly by specially trained officers, properly and privately, before any information is released publicly.",
        "background": "Ban media outlets from reporting on the cause of death until confirmed by emergency services, out of respect for families who may not yet know their loved one is involved \u2014 speculation can cause terrible, avoidable suffering. This includes not reporting on deaths on coastal or inland waters.",
